# Everything is left out of the build unless it is named here. A list of what
# to leave out would have to be kept in step with every local file that
# shouldn't reach an image, such as .env, the database or the index; a list
# of what to let in can't miss one.
*

!app/
!scripts/
!ui/
!data/acmecorp/
!requirements.txt
!requirements-ui.txt

**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
